{"id":"d2a7ec8c3ff53d91","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-effective-closed-complement.md","title":"有效闭类与有效开补","display":"thm-effective-closed-complement — 有效闭类与有效开补","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-effective-closed-complement","aliases":["43-thm-effective-closed-complement"],"display":"thm-effective-closed-complement — 有效闭类与有效开补","depends_on":["[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-df-effective-open]]","[[43-df-stage-enumeration]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.16.1 and Observation 5.16.3, print pp.62–63 / PDF pp.82–83","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-effective-closed-complement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-effective-closed-complement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-effective-closed-complement — 有效闭类与有效开补"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6bef7860773e31d\" href=\"?note=d6bef7860773e31d\" title=\"43-df-stage-enumeration\">43-df-stage-enumeration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.16.1 and Observation 5.16.3, print pp.62–63 / PDF pp.82–83"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d6bef7860773e31d\" href=\"?note=d6bef7860773e31d\" title=\"43-df-stage-enumeration\">43-df-stage-enumeration</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{EffectiveOpen}^A(2^\\omega\\setminus\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{EffectiveOpen}^A(2^\\omega\\setminus\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可判定树的非节点柱集给出开补；反向用长度阶段尚未被枚举禁前缀排除的节点建可判定树，不能直接假定原枚举补树可判定。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.16.1 and Observation 5.16.3, print pp.62–63 / PDF pp.82–83。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-open]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-stage-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"d6bef7860773e31d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-stage-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]、[[43-df-stage-enumeration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]、[[43-df-stage-enumeration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-stage-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"d6bef7860773e31d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-effective-open]]、[[43-df-stage-enumeration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{EffectiveOpen}^A(2^\\omega\\setminus\\mathcal C).","display":true}],"bytes":1300,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-effective-closed-complement]] — 有效闭类与有效开补"},{"id":"7e3484b94f13a4f9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["cc07cf2b9ec0019e","7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","d6bef7860773e31d"]}